<title>UK: BZW sets warrants on the MIB index.</title>
<headline>BZW sets warrants on the MIB index.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-02-13</dateline>
<text>
<p>BZW Warrants Ltd has issued 90 million European-style call and put warrants, in nine equal tranches, on THE MIB index, lead manager BZW Securities said.</p>
<p>COMMON TERMS:</p>
<p>ONE WARRANT CONTROLS ONE MIB INDEX.</p>
<p> EXPIRATION	31.DEC.97		 PAYDATE	06.MAR.97</p>
<p> LISTING	   LUXEMBOURG		SPOT REF     18700 ITL</p>
<p>* *  * * * * * *</p>
<p> TYPE	   STRIKE	    ISSUE</p>
<p> CALL	   19000 ITL	 1805 ITL</p>
<p> CALL	   20000 ITL	 1372 ITL</p>
<p> CALL	   21000 ITL	 1022 ITL</p>
<p> CALL	   22000 ITL	 757  ITL</p>
<p> PUT	    15000 ITL	 469  ITL</p>
<p> PUT	    16000 ITL	 627  ITL</p>
<p> PUT	    17000 ITL	 842  ITL</p>
<p> PUT	    18000 ITL	 1125 ITL</p>
<p> PUT	    19000 ITL	 1516 ITL</p>
<p>--Reuter London Newsroom +44 171 542 7658</p>
</text>
